n\\begin{aligned}\n\\intx^{2} + 1dx &= \\intx^{2}dx + \\int1dx \\\\\n&= \\intx^{2}dx + \\intx^{0}dx \\\\\n&= (\\frac{x^{2 + 1}}{2 + 1}) + x + C \\\\\n&= \\frac{1}{3}x^{3} + x + C\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186184058 #edb/ref 1069 "e-372" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186184058 #edb/ref 1071 "Calculate $\\displaystyle \\int 2 x^3 - x \\,\\textrm d x$." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186184058 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "ea7dadee-2b44-5e62-bef4-26fb0cb185ea" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186184058 #edb/ref 1074 "Using the sum and constant factor rules, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\int2x^{3} - xdx &= 2\\intx^{3}dx - \\intxdx \\\\\n&= 2(\\frac{x^{3 + 1}}{3 + 1}) - (\\frac{x^{1 + 1}}{1 + 1}) + C \\\\\n&= 2(\\frac{x^{4}}{4}) - (\\frac{x^{2}}{2}) + C \\\\\n&= \\frac{x^{4}}{2} - \\frac{x^{2}}{2} + C\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186184059 #edb/ref 1069 "e-373" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186184059 #edb/ref 1071 "Calculate $\\displaystyle \\int \\left(5(\\sqrt{x})^{3} - 4 x^2 + 5\\right) \\,\\textrm d x$." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186184059 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "8f99b603-2fba-5a58-9966-b91d3a8a773e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186184059 #edb/ref 1074 "Using the sum and constant factor rules, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\int(5(\\sqrt{x})^{3} - 4x^{2} + 5)dx &= \\int(5x^{3/2} - 4x^{2} + 5)dx \\\\\n&= 5\\intx^{3/2}dx - 4\\intx^{2}dx + 5\\int1dx \\\\\n&= 5(\\frac{x^{5/2}}{\\frac{5}{2}}) - 4(\\frac{x^{3}}{3}) + 5(x) + C \\\\\n&= 5 \\cdot \\frac{2}{5}x^{5/2} - \\frac{4}{3}x^{3} + 5x + C \\\\\n&= 2\\sqrt{x^{5}} - \\frac{4}{3}x^{3} + 5x + C\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186184153 #edb/ref 1037 #edb/ref 17592186049481 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186184153 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186184549 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186184153 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186184738 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186184153 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186233186 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186184153 #edb/ref 